{"id":"MOEX-112100-1301-Q007","title":"頸外靜脈：跨胸鎖乳突肌表面，注入鎖骨下靜脈","version":"v4","batch":"112-2-med1-q1-50","sourceSha256":"2e1eec3dc793b9779e55cc3f47bc6355ecb2cbf45c0eeb381e399556c99ca3d2","shortHtml":"<p>本題選 <strong>D</strong>。頸外靜脈收集部分頭皮及顏面區的靜脈血，沿<strong>胸鎖乳突肌表面</strong>斜向下走；在頸根部穿入深頸筋膜，通常注入<strong>鎖骨下靜脈</strong>。</p>","html":"<h2>頸外靜脈：跨胸鎖乳突肌表面，注入鎖骨下靜脈</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：D</p><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:588px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.84\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/e643484068d2fffb1b3df9c90e778f24cb995e8a23ff89392969b9a2420ff4b5.png\" alt=\"頸外靜脈在胸鎖乳突肌表面斜向下行\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"588\" height=\"700\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/e643484068d2fffb1b3df9c90e778f24cb995e8a23ff89392969b9a2420ff4b5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>先找 sterno-cleido-mastoideus（胸鎖乳突肌），沿跨在表面的 external jugular（頸外靜脈）向下追；深處的 internal jugular（頸內靜脈）是另一條路線。Henry Gray／Henry Vandyke Carter，1918，圖557，公有領域；此圖看表面走向，下圖接續看匯流。</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>先用胸鎖乳突肌區分頸外與頸內靜脈</h3>\n<p>本題選 <strong>D</strong>。頸外靜脈收集部分頭皮及顏面區的靜脈血，沿<strong>胸鎖乳突肌表面</strong>斜向下走；在頸根部穿入深頸筋膜，通常注入<strong>鎖骨下靜脈</strong>。</p>\n<p>頸外靜脈通常由<strong>下頜後靜脈的後支與耳後靜脈</strong>匯成。下頜後靜脈在耳下腺區與部分顏面、頭皮引流相連，因此 D 使用「部分顏面」而不是「全部顏面」很重要。常見顏面靜脈路線也可以經共同顏面靜脈到頸內靜脈；不能把整張臉的靜脈血都指定由頸外靜脈收走。</p>\n<h3>A、B、C其實把深部路線套到表淺靜脈</h3>\n<p>A把頸外靜脈歸成深層靜脈，B把它放到胸鎖乳突肌下方，都與典型表面走向不符。雖然它在頸根部會穿過深筋膜，<strong>末端穿深筋膜不等於整段都屬深層</strong>。判斷表淺或深部走向時，要抓題目所描述的主要行程。</p>\n<p>C的「與迷走神經伴行」容易讓人想到<strong>頸動脈鞘</strong>：迷走神經與頸動脈、頸內靜脈位於這個深部血管神經鞘內。頸外靜脈從胸鎖乳突肌表面下行，不是頸動脈鞘內那條伴隨迷走神經的大靜脈。</p>\n<h3>看見頸部靜脈，先問它的終點</h3>\n<p>頸內靜脈與鎖骨下靜脈會合形成頭臂靜脈；頸外靜脈典型先匯入鎖骨下靜脈。兩條都能把頭頸血液帶回胸腔，卻在<strong>胸鎖乳突肌表面／深面、是否在頸動脈鞘、直接匯入何處</strong>上不同。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1817px;--reviewed-image-ratio:3.3648148148148147\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/6ce3bc223bd97ba653770efacc28a17af50996dbc3f796c7930047e2dc63eedb.png\" alt=\"外頸靜脈在無遮擋的頸根部直接接入鎖骨下靜脈\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1817\" height=\"540\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/6ce3bc223bd97ba653770efacc28a17af50996dbc3f796c7930047e2dc63eedb.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>沿圖右上 External jugular（頸外靜脈）細管向下，可直接看見它接入橫向 Subclavian（鎖骨下靜脈）的匯口。Internal jugular（頸內靜脈）則與鎖骨下靜脈合成 Brachiocephalic（頭臂靜脈）；不要把這兩個會合點混為一談。OpenStax College，<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2132_Thoracic_Abdominal_Veins.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖</a>，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 3.0</a>；擷取上胸與頸根區，標籤與匯口未改。 <span>Access for free at <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology/pages/1-introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology/pages/1-introduction</a></span></figcaption></figure><details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼1301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?code=112100&amp;t=A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2023-09-05更正清冊：本科無更正紀錄</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10052824/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rusu等（2023）原始綜述：頸外靜脈形成、跨胸鎖乳突肌表面及鎖骨下匯入</a></li><li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/anatomyofhumanbo1918gray/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gray原始解剖書：頸筋膜、頸動脈鞘與迷走神經</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray557.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gray 1918原解剖圖557及公有領域依據</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2132_Thoracic_Abdominal_Veins.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax主要靜脈圖：外頸靜脈接入鎖骨下靜脈的直接匯口與CC BY 3.0</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：D"}